spans.s:
वर्गीय, अस्, आ, अम्, = वर्गीण above; belonging
to a class of consonants, (क-वर्गीय, a Guttural;
प-वर्गीय, a Palatal.)

. fr.
rt. वृ), N. of a river and of the adjacent district;
the sun.

वर्तिष्णु, उस्, उस्, उ, turning, revolving, circular;
abiding, staying, being stationary or fixed; standing
firm in battle, facing (an enemy).

1. वर्धित, अस्, आ, अम्, cut, off, divided;
filled, full, (in this sense probably rather to be placed
under 2. वर्धित below.)

वर्षक, अस्, आ, अम्, raining, falling like rain;
= वर्ष, a year (at the end of an adj. comp., e. g.
पञ्च-वर्षक, five years old).

वारकिन्, ई, m. an opposer, obstructor, enemy;
the ocean; a horse with good marks; an ascetic,
a hermit who lives on leaves.
